346
00:22:04,440 --> 00:22:05,280
By…

347
00:22:08,480 --> 00:22:11,040
Is… Is something wrong with Xu Chi?

348
00:22:12,080 --> 00:22:13,400
Something happened
with the apartment she's buying.

349
00:22:14,440 --> 00:22:17,240
