have to do with you?

350
00:22:17,320 --> 00:22:19,920
<i>Man, don't you hate Wen Ruosen?</i>

351
00:22:20,000 --> 00:22:20,960
Haven't you been dreaming of making

352
00:22:21,040 --> 00:22:22,680
him pay for what he did
to Jingshang's victims?

353
00:22:22,760 --> 00:22:23,920
How could you let

354
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:26,200
